[{"id":74170,"sender_id":494,"sender_full_name":"PaoloPerrone","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ebe8d69259f6a6c8fe452266ed4c80a6?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/writing.20tables.20on.20the.20nLab/near/74170\">#1</a> What is the most up-to-date and elegant way of writing tables on the nLab? I’m thinking of something similar to the one appearing at <a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/periodic%20table\">periodic table</a>. Shall I just copy from the way it is done there?</p>","timestamp":1547483517,"subject":"writing tables on the nLab","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74177,"sender_id":647,"sender_full_name":"Ali Caglayan","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6454cf49f9cd8b51a43e333a3bcad2b?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/writing.20tables.20on.20the.20nLab/near/74177\">#2</a> That’s the best way. You can also write a html table and copy that in. There are many editors for html tables. I asked a similar question a bit ago too.</p>","timestamp":1547493791,"subject":"writing tables on the nLab","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74251,"sender_id":494,"sender_full_name":"PaoloPerrone","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ebe8d69259f6a6c8fe452266ed4c80a6?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/writing.20tables.20on.20the.20nLab/near/74251\">#3</a> Very good, thanks. Another question, how do I put math inside a table?</p>","timestamp":1547747906,"subject":"writing tables on the nLab","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]},{"id":74260,"sender_id":10,"sender_full_name":"Mike Shulman","avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ede34282f405f902e12fa7e6cf336572?d=identicon&version=1","content":"<p><a href=\"#narrow/channel/1-nLab/topic/writing.20tables.20on.20the.20nLab/near/74260\">#4</a> Just do it.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>a</th>\n<th>table</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","timestamp":1547761682,"subject":"writing tables on the nLab","stream_id":1,"display_recipient":"nLab","reactions":[]}]